# Codex post-audit fix (P2-02): enforce LF line endings for text files this
# repository generates and/or diffs byte-for-byte, so a Windows checkout
# (or any CRLF-normalizing git config) cannot introduce a line-ending-only
# difference into content that scripts/registry/validate-registry.mjs and
# the GraphQL contract-drift test compare against a committed snapshot.
# The comparison logic itself is ALSO EOL-normalized (defense in depth) —
# this file prevents the drift from being introduced in the first place.
* text=auto eol=lf
